    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "your hand",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'deal'"
      },
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "hand"
      ],
      "text": "Your hand:"
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "pass",
      "label": "first card to pass",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'deal' and hand_number <= last_passing_hand"
      },
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "hand"
        }
      },
      "store": "pass_1",
      "text": "Hand {hand_number}: choose the FIRST of the 2 cards you will pass (left in hand 1, right in hand 2, across in hand 3). Nobody sees your choice until all have chosen."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "pass",
      "label": "offer the second pass",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'deal' and hand_number <= last_passing_hand"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in you.hand if c != you.pass_1]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "pass",
      "label": "second card to pass",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'deal' and hand_number <= last_passing_hand"
      },
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "store": "pass_2",
      "text": "Choose the SECOND card you will pass. Nobody sees your choice until all have chosen."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "pass",
      "label": "the cards move",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'deal' and hand_number <= last_passing_hand"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "received",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[players[(you.seat - 1 - [1, 3, 2][hand_number - 1] + num_players) % num_players].pass_1, players[(you.seat - 1 - [1, 3, 2][hand_number - 1] + num_players) % num_players].pass_2]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.pass_1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.pass_2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.received[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.received[1]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "pass",
      "label": "passing complete",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'deal' and hand_number <= last_passing_hand"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Passing is complete. You passed {pass_1} and {pass_2}, and received {received}. Your hand is now {hand}."
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "pass",
      "label": "no pass",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'deal' and hand_number > last_passing_hand"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Passing is complete: there was no pass in hand {hand_number}. Your hand is {hand}."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "lead",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'trick'"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == leader"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "hand"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "lead_card"
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} leads {value}."
      },
      "text": "You lead this trick. Play any card from your hand."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "the lead is placed",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'trick'"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "played_card",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "leader"
            },
            "key": "played_card",
            "value": "$lead_card"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "led_suit",
            "value": {
              "calc": "$lead_card[-1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "leader"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": "$lead_card"
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "played_cards",
            "value": "$lead_card"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in you.hand if c[-1] == led_suit] if any(c[-1] == led_suit for c in you.hand) else you.hand"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "second to play",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'trick'"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == (leader % num_players) + 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "f2"
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} plays {value}."
      },
      "text": "Led suit is {led_suit}. Play a card: you must follow suit if you can; if you cannot, any card is allowed."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "third to play",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'trick'"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == ((leader + 1) % num_players) + 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "f3"
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} plays {value}."
      },
      "text": "Led suit is {led_suit}. Play a card: you must follow suit if you can; if you cannot, any card is allowed."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "fourth to play",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'trick'"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == ((leader + 2) % num_players) + 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "f4"
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} plays {value}."
      },
      "text": "Led suit is {led_suit}. Play a card: you must follow suit if you can; if you cannot, any card is allowed."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "the trick is won",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'trick'"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "(leader % num_players) + 1"
            },
            "key": "played_card",
            "value": "$f2"
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "(leader % num_players) + 1"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": "$f2"
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "played_cards",
            "value": "$f2"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "((leader + 1) % num_players) + 1"
            },
            "key": "played_card",
            "value": "$f3"
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "((leader + 1) % num_players) + 1"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": "$f3"
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "played_cards",
            "value": "$f3"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "((leader + 2) % num_players) + 1"
            },
            "key": "played_card",
            "value": "$f4"
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "((leader + 2) % num_players) + 1"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": "$f4"
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "played_cards",
            "value": "$f4"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "card_rank",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(rank_value_ace if you.played_card[0] == 'A' else rank_value_king if you.played_card[0] == 'K' else rank_value_queen if you.played_card[0] == 'Q' else rank_value_jack if you.played_card[0] == 'J' else rank_value_nine if you.played_card[0] == '9' else rank_value_eight) if you.played_card[-1] == led_suit else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min([p.seat for p in players if p.card_rank == max([q.card_rank for q in players])])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([(points_quinola_jack_of_hearts if p.played_card == 'JH' else points_ace if p.played_card[0] == 'A' else points_king if p.played_card[0] == 'K' else points_queen if p.played_card[0] == 'Q' else points_jack if p.played_card[0] == 'J' else points_nine if p.played_card[0] == '9' else points_eight) for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            },
            "key": "hand_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "trick_points"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            },
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "leader",
            "value": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "trick_number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "trick result",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'trick'"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Seat {trick_winner} wins trick {trick_number} and takes {trick_points} points. Hand points: Seat 1 {players[0].hand_points} ({players[0].tricks_won} tricks), Seat 2 {players[1].hand_points} ({players[1].tricks_won} tricks), Seat 3 {players[2].hand_points} ({players[2].tricks_won} tricks), Seat 4 {players[3].hand_points} ({players[3].tricks_won} tricks)."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "end of hand",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'trick' and trick_number >= tricks_per_hand"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "reversis_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.seat for p in players if p.tricks_won >= reversis_tricks] + [0])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand_score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(reversis_taker_score if you.seat == reversis_seat else reversis_other_score) if reversis_seat > 0 else you.hand_points"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "total",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand_score"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand_points",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stage",
            "value": "deal"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "hand scores",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'trick' and trick_number >= tricks_per_hand"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Hand {hand_number} is over. Reversis by seat: {reversis_seat} (0 means no reversis). Hand scores (running totals): Seat 1 {players[0].hand_score} ({players[0].total}), Seat 2 {players[1].hand_score} ({players[1].total}), Seat 3 {players[2].hand_score} ({players[2].total}), Seat 4 {players[3].hand_score} ({players[3].total})."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "after the last hand",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_kind == 'trick' and trick_number >= tricks_per_hand and hand_number >= num_hands"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "hand_number >= num_hands and trick_number >= tricks_per_hand and stage == 'deal'"
      },
      "rank_by": "0 - you.total",
      "text": "Winner: {result} (lowest total). Final totals: Seat 1 {players[0].total}, Seat 2 {players[1].total}, Seat 3 {players[2].total}, Seat 4 {players[3].total}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 28,
    "rounds_max": 30,
    "actions_max": 3000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "Short Reversis is for {num_players} players, seated in a circle and playing in the order 1, 2, 3, 4, then back to 1. Left is the next seat, right the previous seat, across the seat two away. The deck has {deck_size} cards: A, K, Q, J, 9 and 8 in spades (S), hearts (H), diamonds (D) and clubs (C), written like AS, JH, 9D, 8C. Rank within a suit, high to low: A, K, Q, J, 9, 8. There are no trumps.\n\nThe game is {num_hands} hands. Each hand is {rounds_per_hand} rounds: one passing round, then {tricks_per_hand} trick rounds ({total_rounds} rounds in all).\n\nPASSING ROUND: The deck is shuffled and each player is dealt {cards_dealt_per_player} cards, seen only by that player. In hands 1 to {last_passing_hand}, all players at the same moment secretly choose {pass_count} different cards from their hand to pass (first one card, then a second, different card). The passes go left in hand 1, right in hand 2 and across in hand 3. Passed cards join the receiver's hand only after everyone has chosen; every hand still holds 6 cards, and only the passer and the receiver learn which cards moved. In hand 4 there is no pass. The game then announces that passing is complete.\n\nTRICKS: In the first trick of hand h, seat h leads. In every later trick, the winner of the previous trick leads. Starting with the leader and going round in seat order, each player plays one card face up. The leader may play any card. Each other player must play a card of the led suit if they hold one; if they hold none, they may play any card. The highest card of the led suit wins the trick; cards of other suits never win.\n\nSCORING: The trick winner adds the trick's points to their hand points: A={points_ace}, K={points_king}, Q={points_queen}, J={points_jack}, except the Jack of Hearts (Quinola) = {points_quinola_jack_of_hearts}; 9={points_nine}, 8={points_eight}. Their trick count for the hand goes up by 1. All played cards are public.\n\nEND OF HAND: If one player won all {reversis_tricks} tricks (a reversis), that player scores {reversis_taker_score} for the hand and each other player scores {reversis_other_score}. Otherwise each player scores the card points they took; these always total {points_total_per_hand}. Hand scores are added to public running totals, then hand points and trick counts reset to 0.\n\nEND OF GAME: After hand {num_hands} is scored the game ends. The player with the lowest running total wins; players tied for the lowest total share the result (a draw)."
}
